<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-10-27T23:53:32.656Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 23:53:32 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Somali army convoys continue to be ambushed by al-Shabaab near Baidoa, while al-Shabaab suffered heavy losses in operations that reportedly killed 75 of its fighters. The Somali army also reported a major battle near Buurhakaba district with dozens of its soldiers killed. Fitgharan forces now control the Mogadishu-Baidoa corridor and Laftagareen forces have seized Buurhakaba and a town in Bay, extending combat in the south. Ethiopia has withdrawn over 3,000 troops and will not intervene in the South West State conflict. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPOUxJOVFBa0FLeVdfTkRsZHMwVlhBU2FJU2xPeHVGTks4aUdQbjdEYlZQR0RNU1lTdHMtNHFPcjQ2OV92VkN5LWRVblk4aTdxQ1RVbFdKX0hkTHVxd1VnRVhEZnR2bTU5clh5U2JhWS1xOXRnTGdzemFHNWFLMU51UlJkM1JLMUt2YmtCUkZDVFU4X05WSHZBb3ZVeEZVbFZqb1NNdDF2Um1JaW5Pbk9UYWRpRXY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQNzM4S1gyZ0paSEFQWmpOLUd6WmZsclZsQ0hsVkNlaE02SjdueENSd2xPOFV6bWRyYmszN2ZFamtSUmh2b2hKUUlNWDB0MFJfX3RnQUFOZVFNMExBZUNWd1U5dHRZLUJkMDdhZlQzMVZldGRlczU4d0JCcHg1NktFcllXTjRDM1BZdU5qQVk2dW5LVE1pMHZ0LTAyTU1uYkhqOWNhYlVzS2I?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPc0x4OF8wRmZ1bXpWV0ZQSnYybHJMSF81Q3NFUEVKa0piSzRJQkNGMXl3TmUxQlJZb181ZDZzRGkxVkpia3ZLd0VmQlFxeWNaZ01jYU5EbWQ3ampYeWFuSnpraVBMVzlCQ0hNaXhXSm5yc0d3M2h2NFBVSzR1Tm52dk4wdGNmbGJIVFVBM3lZZUtTdm8wVVBXcThB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQSVk5c1Q3X1BKU0h0dXZJUTNOaVpSR080QkhuOEJFbHYyeWctbTJXYVVKbHpVY0FoZFhNQ2xFRjRKeVdTNmRDbzZOWlQyRHFseGtWXzd2ZHM3amxGcjl3ZWpTYnNHTjhzOEdtYW5EVlo4TDZySkNiSGtTNGUxZzJqc1A3ZDdJY1Ztc1p3eTB3Sy03MHRPcTlhdHJ